      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} Hi Tau, yeah the furry hideout has mirrors with \"point?\" lights in front of it in the main area. Me and a friend noticed a few days ago the only illumination we could get was from the skybox itself. There are several worlds we noticed like Encode the music visualizer world. Reflections from lights seem broke on any avatar we try. At the sametime i noticed my framerate was reporting frames into the hundreds i dont know if its related. When i asked other people in the same instance they report being able to see the lights behaving as normal and lighting them up. I included a picture of the lighting before the issue and after. I originally noticed the issue when specular was completely turning off when not directly facing a light source instead of diming slightly. Im not a light specialist at all, so let me know what kind of info i can dig up to help :). Thanks!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
