      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} No a friend asked me if i could look at a lighting issue they were seeing, which i then noticed i had aswell i updated everything, uninstalled vrchat, tried the beta, tried it in VR, tried it in desktop. Uploaded avatars in 2019/2022. Tested several shaders and setup a few variant shadergraph. Talked with several shader creators, world owners. I was just curious why lighting seemed to break at the same time i was getting 200FPS in game suddenly. I auto update the game so i have no idea. I usually control my shaders through the expression menu to compensate for different worlds so its not something i would have noticed right away. I came here last just trying to see if i could glean some insight into what may be occuring.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
