      "value": "@{66a8603146d0a9d3b5606268|full_name}: If this isn't something that broke between VRChat versions, this is probably not the right place to come.\n\nI can say that most recently no changes to avatar shaders in particular that would affect lighting have been made from VRChat's side as far as I'm aware. If this happens specifically in the beta, perhaps, but not on 1472 (live build).",
